    ["For the whole step: about 12 crafts, 120 Light Leather, 12 Cured Light Hide, 12 Fine Thread."] = "Para todo el paso: unas 12 creaciones, 120 Cuero ligero, 12 Pellejo ligero curtido, 12 Hilo refinado.",
